			"Message": "chore(Wind): Add .gitignore for build artifacts and IDE files\n\nThis commit adds a new .gitignore file to the Wind Element to prevent ephemeral build artifacts and development configuration from being committed to the repository.\n\nChanges include:\n- Target build outputs (excluding debug/release folders)\n- Configuration bundles (TypeScript/ESBuild outputs)\n- Node.js dependencies (.node_modules)\n- Environment files (.env, .env.local)\n- Log files (*.log)\n- IDE configuration (.vscode/, .idea/)\n\nThis aligns with standard project hygiene practices, ensuring that build artifacts and local developer settings are excluded while maintaining the necessary folder structure in the repository.",
